{"doi":"10.1038/s41598-026-47071-y","version":"version of record","title":"Gauge-covariant stochastic neural fields: stability and finite-width effects","authors":["Rodrigo Carmo Terin"],"journal":"Scientific Reports","volume":"16","article":"16386","published":"2026-04-06","abstract":"A classical gauge-covariant stochastic effective field theory organizes neural stability, two-replica response and finite-width corrections.","comment":"Version of record; no Crossref update relation found"},
[sec("作者信息","作者 Rodrigo Carmo Terin；Scientific Reports 16, 16386 (2026)，DOI:10.1038/s41598-026-47071-y，发表于2026-04-06。核验18页期刊版、附录和Crossref；未发现关联更正或撤稿。论文是神经网络稳定性的经典随机有效场论，不主张神经网络与基本粒子规范场物理等价。"),
sec("研究问题","无限宽神经网络可由Gaussian process或kernel描述，但有限宽度涨落、深度传播稳定性和edge of chaos常用不同工具处理。论文问：能否用局域U(1)协变的经典随机场统一表示feature amplitude、structured couplings和随机深度演化，并从两副本响应定义Lyapunov增长与有限宽度修正？"),
sec("背景","模型包含复matter field、实Abelian connection和虚构stochastic depth time；所有场均为commuting variables。局域相位变换要求普通导数换成covariant derivative，从而约束admissible kernels与longitudinal fluctuations。", "作者反复限定有效坐标与d=4只是continuum/kernel geometry，不是物理时空；gauge language是共享形式结构。MSRJD functional把Langevin noise写成response-field path integral，便于计算correlators与linear response。"),
sec("模型与方法","从协变Langevin equations构造MSRJD action，并以Ward-type identity检查局域冗余。两个近邻replicas在相同noise下传播，其difference covariance给amplification kernel；最大特征值跨过1时定义mean-field marginality。", "数值一是随机初始化finite-width MLP，测量扰动随层的经验Lyapunov exponent；二是线性随机effective sector，比较解析dressed spectrum和Monte Carlo spectrum。finite-width expansion按1/N组织，但长观察窗引入T/N，因此只在该比值小的perturbative regime受控。"),
sec("核心结果与证据","两副本构造给出full amplification factor而非只看单点variance；在固定kernel geometry下，论文所保留阶的finite-width correction改变spectral shape，但不移动mean-field marginality condition。这是模型内perturbative consequence，不是所有architecture的exact theorem。", "有限宽MLP数值的instability threshold接近mean-field预测，偏差随宽度减小；线性随机sector中Figure 2显示simulation-averaged power spectrum与theoretical X(ω)在低频修正区吻合。该图验证的是专门线性测试模型，不直接验证完整gauge field theory。", "局域对称性限制observable必须gauge invariant或covariant；这避免把参数化相位当成物理自由度。论文没有展示训练后大型网络、真实任务accuracy或optimizer dynamics，因此结论停留在初始化/有效模型稳定性层。"),
sec("有效性与局限","continuum coordinates、connection field与noise covariance是phenomenological ansatz，未从唯一微观architecture推导。fixed kernel geometry假设排除了有限宽度引起kernel family本身变化的情形；更高阶loops可能移动阈值。", "T/N expansion对深度或观测窗随宽度增长时可能失效。MLP实验规模、activation和初始化有限；edge-of-chaos与泛化、可训练性或最优性能不是同一命题。形式上的Ward identity保证内部一致性，不证明经验模型是神经网络的唯一有效描述。"),
sec("复现与资源","期刊：https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-026-47071-y。核验PDF SHA-256：9bad6e6d9b90b90972142874ad2a555ae8989c2edee47ce56b9abf97ad508212。复现需固定action、gauge fixing、noise normalization、kernel geometry、N、T、activation、weight variance、layer count、replica perturbation和spectral estimator。", "应分别报告mean-field threshold、finite-N drift、T/N范围与seed uncertainty。Evidence status: full-text verified version of record, perturbation theory and finite simulations; no independent reproduction performed."),
sec("阅读指南","先读 pp.2–4 Eqs. (1)–(7)确认场与局域变换，再读 pp.5–8 MSRJD和two-replica kernel。核心数值看 pp.9–11 Figure 2与Table 1；最后读Appendices C–D，检查1/N与T/N counting，并保留‘fixed kernel geometry’限定。")],
"figure-2-spectrum.webp","Figure 2",10,"comparison","线性随机有效模型的模拟功率谱与理论dressed spectrum对比。","有限宽修正在所测低频范围改变谱形，模拟与受控线性sector预测一致。","Figure 2是全文把有限宽度解析修正与数值频谱直接比较的核心证据。",
