{"doi":"10.1038/s42005-023-01173-5","arxiv_id":"2302.09439","version":"arXiv full text","title":"Emergence of synchronised rotations in dense active matter with disorder","authors":["Danial Vahabli","Tamas Vicsek"],"journal":"Communications Physics","volume":"6","article":"56","published":"2023-03-31","abstract":"A two-dimensional soft active-particle simulation develops directional, mixed, globally synchronized rotating and locally rotating states as quenched obstacle density increases.","comment":"arXiv full text cross-checked with version-of-record metadata; no Crossref update relation found"},
[sec("作者信息","作者 Danial Vahabli、Tamas Vicsek；Communications Physics 6, 56 (2023)，DOI:10.1038/s42005-023-01173-5；全文取arXiv:2302.09439，共27页含补充分析。核验Crossref状态；未发现关联更正或撤稿。全部核心结果来自二维particle simulations，没有实验。"),
sec("研究问题","极性active particles在均匀环境中倾向形成全局定向运动，而随机障碍提供isotropic quenched disorder。论文问：随着obstacle density增大，定向流是否只被逐渐破坏，还是会经由局域混合态形成全局同手性旋转；quenched disorder与temporal shot noise同时存在时谁主导相态？"),
sec("背景","模型粒子以恒速自推进，短程alignment和soft repulsion决定方向；固定随机障碍也产生排斥/转向。周期边界下没有外加手性，因此clockwise或anticlockwise全局旋转的选择是spontaneous chiral symmetry breaking。", "Figure 3给出directional、labyrinth、synchronized rotation、bidirectional local rotation、random和meander六类motion patterns。颜色同时编码瞬时方向与旋转手性，是后续order parameters的视觉词典。"),
sec("模型与方法","作者扫描obstacle density、particle density、alignment radius、rotational noise与system size，Euler式更新位置/方向。定义global polarization、局部/全局rotation fraction和angular momentum-like order，通常对160次simulation ensemble统计。", "状态分类结合order-parameter阈值和movie inspection；障碍位置quenched但不同realizations重采样。所谓non-reciprocal transition是对coexisting/moving phases形态的解释，模型的pair rules并未系统推导完整nonreciprocal field theory。"),
sec("核心结果与证据","低障碍密度为directional flow；增加障碍后进入局部定向/旋转共存的labyrinth。窄参数区出现几乎所有粒子同向绕各自局部中心旋转的global synchronized state，尽管没有全局中心或显式chirality bias。", "Figure 4中polar order下降后global rotation order突然上升，再在更高障碍密度下降为CW/CCW局域domains。Figure 3/4是有限L、有限时间数值观察；作者的finite-size scans支持状态不完全是小系统伪影，但未给thermodynamic critical exponents。", "同时加入angular shot noise时，相图主要随quenched obstacle density组织，说明在所扫参数中quenched disorder主导。该结果不是一般定理；若改变noise amplitude、interaction ranges或obstacle dynamics，竞争可改变。"),
sec("有效性与局限","soft particles、固定速度、短程alignment和理想随机障碍是最小模型；没有hydrodynamics、inertia、真实碰撞形状或实验参数映射。rotation center与synchrony metrics依赖轨迹窗口和阈值。", "global chirality可能在更大尺度形成domains而非真正long-range order；模拟sizes不足以严格区分phase transition与crossover。‘non-reciprocal’只表示某些phase-coupling相似性，不能从图样直接推断action–reaction violation或universality class。"),
sec("复现与资源","原文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.09439；期刊：https://doi.org/10.1038/s42005-023-01173-5。PDF SHA-256：ebe5e034506d6e18f36d9fffd09ba868d0f85da3cced2df4b5938445bd7c83ba。复现需固定L、N、speed、radii、alignment/repulsion strengths、obstacle ensemble、dt、run length、transient、noise与state thresholds。", "应报告seed distributions和size scaling而非只给代表movie。Evidence status: full-text verified numerical manuscript; no independent reproduction performed."),
sec("阅读指南","先读 pp.4–7 Eqs. (1)–(5)和Figure 1确认相互作用；再看 p.13 Figure 3建立状态分类，pp.14–17 Figures 4–6核查order parameters、noise与size effects。最后将作者的nonreciprocal analogy与直接数值结果分开。")],
"figure-3-motion-states.webp","Figure 3",13,"phase_diagram","六种二维active-particle运动图样及方向/手性色标。","各向同性quenched disorder把极性流依次重组为混合态、全局同步旋转和局域双手性旋转。","Figure 3是全文状态分类的直接视觉证据，并为后续序参量曲线定义图样。",
