{"doi":"10.1038/s42256-024-00918-3","version":"version of record","title":"Efficient rare event sampling with unsupervised normalizing flows","authors":["Solomon Asghar","Qing-Xiang Pei","Giorgio Volpe","Ran Ni"],"journal":"Nature Machine Intelligence","volume":"6","pages":"1370–1381","published":"2024-11-19","abstract":"FlowRES trains normalizing-flow proposals inside path-space MCMC without prior transition data or collective variables for passive and active Brownian benchmarks.","comment":"Open-access repository copy of version of record; no Crossref update relation found"},
[sec("作者信息","作者 Solomon Asghar、Qing-Xiang Pei、Giorgio Volpe、Ran Ni；Nature Machine Intelligence 6, 1370–1381 (2024)，DOI:10.1038/s42256-024-00918-3。核验UCL开放仓储18页期刊版、代码与Crossref；未发现关联更正或撤稿。"),
sec("研究问题","metastable transitions随barrier增大呈指数稀少，直接Langevin integration几乎看不到；TPS仍可能因proposal不能连接端点而失效。论文问：能否在path space中用normalizing flow从MCMC已接受样本自举训练非局域proposal，无需预先transition data或手工collective variable，并保持对更稀事件的效率？"),
sec("背景","路径W含固定初态到终态时间序列，target distribution是满足动力学action并到达目标区域的transition-path ensemble。FlowRES以Gaussian basis经invertible affine coupling flow生成proposal，再用Metropolis–Hastings acceptance校正，因此network只改善proposal，不替代目标权重。", "Figure 1展示two-particle rare path和训练闭环：当前accepted paths训练flow，flow proposal经MCMC接受后更新distribution，逐步逼近target。"),
sec("模型与方法","基准含passive Brownian double well、带不可穿墙或双通道potential，以及active Brownian particles的非平衡转移。active case同时生成position与periodic orientation，角噪声用von Mises base处理。", "作者与direct integration、TPS比较Jensen–Shannon distance、target paths per proposal、wall time/force evaluations及barrier scaling。多个parallel chains减少相关性；normalizing flow训练本身计入成本的方式需结合Methods理解。"),
sec("核心结果与证据","Figure 2中barrier从1增至18 kBT_eff时，direct integration与TPS所需proposals快速增加，而FlowRES生成收敛path ensemble的成本近似保持常数；marginal path densities与直接模拟在可比较barrier吻合。", "Figure 3的active Brownian benchmark在非平衡且orientation隐藏于简单位置CV时仍重现transition ensemble；Figure 4的双通道potential同时发现两条route，不需要事先指定channel coordinate。", "所谓无监督是没有预先rare-event dataset或label；算法仍知道初/终区域、dynamics和path action，并从MCMC acceptance获得目标信号。近常数效率只在所测低维benchmark/barrier范围成立，不是维度无关复杂度证明。"),
sec("有效性与局限","测试主要是一到两粒子的低维Brownian systems，normalizing flow对长路径、多粒子与stiff molecular coordinates的训练/内存可能恶化。固定path length与已知transition endpoints排除了未知事件发现问题。", "MH correction保证stationary target需proposal support、detailed implementation和chain mixing；有限JSD不能排除mode遗漏。non-equilibrium action、periodic angles和constraints必须正确编码。多route样例支持能力但不能证明任意topology都被覆盖。"),
sec("复现与资源","期刊：https://doi.org/10.1038/s42256-024-00918-3；代码：https://github.com/SolomonAsghar/FlowRES。PDF SHA-256：2be64689df4e3e076fbfe121ca464caf4b2b6a436b1cd15ba46e0a0b92cd873c。复现需固定SDE discretization、path length、endpoint sets、flow layers、base distribution、parallel chains、MH ratio、training schedule、barrier与JSD estimator。", "Evidence status: full-text verified version of record with simulated benchmarks; no independent reproduction performed."),
sec("阅读指南","先看 p.2 Figure 1理解flow proposal仍受MH校正；再读 pp.3–5 Figure 2的barrier scaling。active和multi-route证据看 pp.6–8 Figures 3–4，最后读Methods核查path action、acceptance与成本口径，避免把benchmark scaling写成普适保证。")],
